{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30856","headline":"边馆逢贺秀才 · 马戴","name":"边馆逢贺秀才","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"贫病无疎我与君，不知何事久离羣。\n鹿裘共弊同爲客，龙阙将移拟献文。\n空馆夕阳鸦绕树，荒城寒色鴈和云。\n不堪吟断边笳晓，叶落东西客又分。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"马戴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30856.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30856","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}